Package: spectra2rgb
Type: Package
Title: Convert Spectral Signatures to sRGB and CIELAB Colour
        Coordinates
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Jhohan", "Elguera", email = "jelguerat@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts hyperspectral reflectance signatures to sRGB hex codes and
    CIE L*a*b* coordinates using the
    CIE 1931 2-degree standard observer and the D65 standard illuminant.
    CIELAB coordinates are calculated directly from CIE XYZ values;
    sRGB output is generated independently. Includes bundled reference
    data so the package is self-contained.
    Handles missing and non-finite reflectance values via a configurable
    policy.
